"mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "original_size", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [271.8443298339844, 234], "pos": [540.1476440429688, 996.7427978515625], "widgets_values": [0.30000000000000004, "lanczos", "longest", 768, "8"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 176, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "link": 177, "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "original_size", "label": "original_size", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale"}, "name": "scale", "label": "scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "method"}, "name": "method", "label": "method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "method"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_to_side"}, "name": "scale_to_side", "label": "scale_to_side", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "scale_to_side"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_to_length"}, "name": "scale_to_length", "label": "scale_to_length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "scale_to_length"}, {"widget": {"name": "round_to_multiple"}, "name": "round_to_multiple", "label": "round_to_multiple", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "round_to_multiple"}], "flags": {}, "id": 108, "type": "ImageScaleRestore_UTK", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScaleRestore_UTK"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["模型地址：\nhttps://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler\n\n型号：选择您的 DiT 型号\n\n3B 型号：速度更快，显存需求更低\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensorsFP8 8位（高质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.ggufGGUF 8 位量化（高质量）\n\n7B 型号：画质更高，显存需求更高\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors：FP8，最后一个数据块使用FP16，以减少伪影（质量良好）\n\nseedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_*：锐化版本，增强细节\n设备：用于 DiT 推理的 GPU 设备（例如，cuda:0）\n\noffload_device：当 DiT 模型不处于活跃处理状态时，用于卸载 DiT 模型的设备\n\nnone：将模型保存在推理设备（速度最快、显存最大的设备）上\ncpu：卸载到系统内存（减少显存）\ncuda:X：将负载转移到另一块GPU（如果可用，则可获得良好的负载均衡）\ncache_model：在工作流运行之间，保持卸载设备上的 DiT 模型加载状态\n\n适用于批量处理，避免重复加载\n需要设置 offload_device\nblocks_to_swap：块交换内存优化\n\n0：已禁用（默认）\n1-32：需要替换为 3B 型号的变压器模块数量\n1-36：需要更换为 7B 型号的变压器模块数量\n数值越高，节省的显存越多，但处理速度越慢。\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nswap_io_components：卸载输入/输出嵌入和归一化层\n\n结合 blocks_to_swap 可进一步节省 VRAM\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n\nsdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\nflash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "DiT 型号说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [391.4128723144531, 534.8658447265625], "pos": [844.0072631835938, 1006.82275390625], "id": 109, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["```\n欢迎进入我的主页\nQQ交流群：821194069\n可定制工作流和模型和远程部署！\n\n```\n---\n\n### 公众号直达：[AIGC特异点](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HPH9c0lymUxKDipVcw7PCQ)👈\n### B站直达：[AIGC特异点](https://space.bilibili.com/49766729?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0 )👈\n### 闲鱼店铺直达：[AI服务](https://www.goofish.com/personal?spm=a21ybx.home.nav.1.4c053da6H5SqxH)👈\n### runninghub主页：[AIGC特异点](https://www.runninghub.cn/?inviteCode=sdhs0trb)👈\n### LIBLIBAI主页：[模型Lora](https://www.liblib.art/userpage/4230c933675a4170a1c9e7b4273325d5/publish )👈\n### Youtube主页：[AIGC-Singularity](https://www.youtube.com/@AIGC-Singularity)👈\n### 微博：[热血啊ban](https://weibo.com/u/8018389779)👈\n### civitai：[AIGC_Singularity](https://civitai.green/user/AIGC_Singularity)👈"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "我的主页", "mode": 0, 